          "source_quote": "ἐνιδὼν τῇ καμίνῳ τέταρτον ἔφη",
          "english_quote": "looked into the furnace and spoke of a fourth",
          "issue": "τέταρτον is the object of ἐνιδών: the narrator says that Nebuchadnezzar perceived a fourth person in the furnace. The draft instead describes looking into the furnace and attaches the fourth person to speaking. Although the following quotation reports his seeing, it does not preserve this narrated construction accurately.",
          "suggested_revision": "Replace this wording with “saw a fourth in the furnace and said,” followed by the existing quotation. Review the revised sentence afresh.",
